        "content": "Select a Job ID. Read top-down: scheduler outcome \u2192 application progress/errors \u2192 exact trays \u2192 GPU/HCA/host evidence \u2192 parsed benchmark result \u2192 raw logs. Missing source coverage is shown as missing, never as healthy zero.",
